menu "Michi Music Stream Hardware"

    config MICHI_DAC_I2C_SDA
        int "External DAC I2C SDA pin"
        default 22
        help
          External DAC (PCM5122) I2C data pin. Default 22 is a free GPIO with no
          Waveshare ESP32-S3-LCD-2 collision. REQUIRES physical validation: measure
          continuity between the DAC SDA line and GPIO22 on your unit.

    config MICHI_DAC_I2C_SCL
        int "External DAC I2C SCL pin"
        default 23
        help
          External DAC (PCM5122) I2C clock pin. Default 23 is a free GPIO with no
          Waveshare ESP32-S3-LCD-2 collision. REQUIRES physical validation: measure
          continuity between the DAC SCL line and GPIO23 on your unit.

    config MICHI_I2S_BCLK
        int "External DAC I2S BCLK pin"
        default 3
        help
          I2S bit clock to the external DAC. Default 3 is a free GPIO with no
          Waveshare ESP32-S3-LCD-2 collision. REQUIRES physical validation: measure
          continuity between the DAC BCLK line and GPIO3 on your unit.

    config MICHI_I2S_LRCK
        int "External DAC I2S LRCK pin"
        default 18
        help
          I2S left/right clock to the external DAC. Default 18 is a free GPIO with
          no Waveshare ESP32-S3-LCD-2 collision. REQUIRES physical validation:
          measure continuity between the DAC LRCK line and GPIO18 on your unit.

    config MICHI_I2S_DIN
        int "External DAC I2S DIN pin"
        default 5
        help
          I2S serial data to the external DAC. Default 5 is a free GPIO with no
          Waveshare ESP32-S3-LCD-2 collision. REQUIRES physical validation: measure
          continuity between the DAC DIN line and GPIO5 on your unit.

    config MICHI_I2S_MCLK
        int "External DAC I2S MCLK pin"
        default 46
        help
          Optional master clock for the external DAC. The PCM5122 has an internal
          PLL, so MCLK can be left unconnected; set to -1 to disable it. Default 46
          is a free GPIO with no Waveshare ESP32-S3-LCD-2 collision. REQUIRES
          physical validation: measure continuity between the DAC MCLK line and
          GPIO46 on your unit.

    config MICHI_LED_GPIO
        int "External LED (SK6812) data pin"
        default 24
        help
          Data pin for the external SK6812 LED strip (M5Stack U003). Default 24 is
          a free GPIO with no Waveshare ESP32-S3-LCD-2 collision. REQUIRES physical
          validation: measure continuity between the LED data line and GPIO24 on
          your unit.

    config MICHI_BUTTON_GPIO
        int "External pairing button pin"
        default 25
        help
          External pairing button input, active low to GND. Default 25 is a free
          GPIO with no Waveshare ESP32-S3-LCD-2 collision. REQUIRES physical
          validation: measure continuity between the button pin and GPIO25, and
          verify the button pulls the pin to GND when pressed.

endmenu
